rather than inventing a value\r\n- **Default `false` everywhere** — developers opt in by flipping the flag; production stays clean\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Quality Checks\r\n\r\n- ✅ `dotnet build aspire1.sln --no-restore --configuration Release` — succeeded (pre-existing NU1902 warnings only, no new errors)\r\n- ✅ `dotnet test aspire1.Web.Tests --no-build --configuration Release` — **44/44 passed** (5 new + 39 existing)\r\n- ✅ No fake data, no hard-coded values, no secrets\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Commit\r\n\r\n`feat(view): diagnostics panel crashes the weather card party -- behind a flag, dev-eyes only 🔍`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nRefs #32\r\n",
